<CourseLayout title="Put the skill to work." description="Individual practice, a paired recovery and a four-role final mission. Every assessment asks you to apply capabilities in a new setting." eyebrow="THE COURSE / ASSESSMENTS">
<AssessmentSummary/>
<h2>From workshop to recovery team.</h2><p>A1 brings observation, recall, spatial reasoning and mechanisms together in the Sealed Workshop. A2 restores a relay through electronics, investigation, permissions and precise communication. The final project integrates the semester at Meridian Station.</p>
<p>The best ten weekly fieldwork records contribute 10%. Assessments reward practical evidence, diagnosis, transfer, coordination and explanation. A game ending alone cannot establish academic achievement.</p>
<p>All due times use Australia/Canberra. Each brief publishes deliverables, marking criteria and performance standards. The website provides local practice and exports; your institution's submission arrangements remain separate.</p>
<p><a href={withBase("/policies/")}>Read collaboration, extension and accessibility policies</a></p>
</CourseLayout>
